5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Since we are expanding, we should be thorough. I'm interested in the financial and logistical constraints first.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know how to make the seats feel nice. I wonder if the desks are comfortable for everyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make sure we don't waste our time with a messy transition! I want to know about the actual daily flow.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not pretend this is a purely altruistic exercise. Some spots are objectively worse than others. I'll look into the history of this.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I just want to make sure we know the costs... and maybe how the power works... so we don't regret it later.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, that's a fair point. We should definitely check the infrastructure costs before deciding on a layout.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, do you think the sound matters too? I think it might be important for focusing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, totally! But I'm more worried about the ""hidden"" time sinks. Let's see what the people upstairs are doing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the ""pilot floor"" is probably just a fancy way of saying they have better chairs. I'm more interested in the actual data.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree that data is key. I'll focus on the billing and the power quotes to see what we can actually afford.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll look into the sound and the physio's notes. I want to know if the desks hurt our backs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'm going for the morning routine upstairs and the badge records. I want to see when people actually arrive.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the unplanned shuffles and the staff survey. I want to see who's been pushed around in the past.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll check the facilities quote and the floor billing too. Just to be sure.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
