35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It seems the costs are quite rigid. We are paying for space regardless of use, and every change to the layout is expensive.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that the sound is louder near the door. And the physio said it takes a long time to make a chair feel right.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Oh, you guys are so boring! I found out that the ""morning setup"" is a total time-sink. We're losing minutes every single day.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"How charming. While you're worrying about minutes, I've discovered we have a window shortage. Some of us will be in the dark.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... the power quotes are... really high. 6,200 yen per desk. If we change our minds later, we have to pay it all over again.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, exactly. This means we cannot afford a ""trial"" period. We must get the layout right the first time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, if we have to get it right, can we make sure the loud areas aren't where we spend the most time?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, sure, but if we make it too complex, we'll spend ten minutes every morning just figuring out where to sit!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, please. We aren't toddlers. The real issue is that some of us will be staring at a wall while others enjoy the view.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm worried that if we just pick a layout now, we might end up sitting next to people we can't talk to... and it'll be too expensive to change.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,We need a layout that balances the budget with the physical needs. We can't just move things on a whim.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just want to make sure we don't put people in the loud spots. It makes it hard to think.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm telling you, the badge records show we don't even arrive at the same time. A ""fixed"" seat is the only way to avoid morning chaos.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A ""fixed"" seat is just a polite way of saying some people get the window and some don't. Let's be honest about the hierarchy.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Maybe... maybe we should talk about who sits where... before we finalize the plan? So we don't feel stuck?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's look at the options provided and decide based on the cost and the noise issues.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we can pick the one that is the most comfortable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"As long as it doesn't eat up my morning, I'm happy with anything.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll vote for the one that acknowledges the disparity. Let's not pretend we're all equal in the eyes of the floor plan.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll just go with what the group thinks is best.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
